---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components'
import Base from '#layouts/Base.astro'
---

<Base
  title="Privacy"
  description="Data QueerOmaha.net collects, why, and who it's shared with."
>
  <article class="legal-page">
    <wa-card class="legal-card">
      <h2 slot="header">
        <Icon
          name="fa7-solid:shield-halved"
          width="1.25em"
          height="1.25em"
          aria-hidden="true"
        />
        Privacy
      </h2>

      <h3>Data Collected</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Analytics.</strong> PostHog is configured in cookieless mode and
          client IP addresses are redacted before logging.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Suggestion Box and Contact submissions.</strong> Submissions are
          emailed to site admins by our hosting provider (Cloudflare, or Netlify
          while we finish moving off it). Email addresses are only used for
          correspondence and not for marketing.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Why</h3>
      <p>
        To understand which categories and listings people use, and receive
        suggestions and messages from the community.
      </p>

      <h3>Who we share it with</h3>
      <p>
        PostHog Inc. (analytics), Cloudflare, Inc. (site hosting and form
        email), and, until our move to Cloudflare is done, Netlify, Inc. (site
        hosting and form handling). We don't sell data or share it.
      </p>

      <h3>How long we keep it</h3>
      <p>
        Analytics events are kept per PostHog's standard retention. Suggestion
        Box and Contact submissions are kept in the admins' inbox until
        actioned; Cloudflare doesn't store them, and Netlify keeps the ones it
        handles according to its data retention.
      </p>

      <h3>Questions</h3>
      <p>
        Email <a href="mailto:privacy@queeromaha.net">privacy@queeromaha.net</a> or
        use the <a href="/contact">contact form</a>.
      </p>

      <p>
        <a class="back-link" href="/friends">
          <Icon
            name="fa7-solid:arrow-left"
            width="1.25em"
            height="1.25em"
            aria-hidden="true"
          />
          Go Back to the homepage
        </a>
      </p>
    </wa-card>
  </article>
</Base>
